      ],
      "source": "https://www.lowerbrulesiouxtribe.com/copy-of-enrollment-2"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Cultural resource projects in West Brule focus on protecting traditional culture, tribal history, and land use management.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.lowerbrulesiouxtribe.com/copy-of-enrollment-2"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Tribal officials in West Brule maintain an electronic archive of Tribal Council proceedings and documents related to Lower Brule history.",
